From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron contributors <electron@github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: feat: share Chromium certificate viewer data and resource setup

Extract the existing certificate view data construction for reuse by embedders
without Chrome Profile. Chrome and Electron call the same helpers. Keep the
original certificate viewer HTML, CSS, TypeScript and tree components intact.

